# EP Radar needs no API key. Claude features (employer reviews, interview process, and reading
# hours/times out of each ad) use your Claude subscription through Claude Code:
#   - On this computer: just be logged in to Claude Code (run `claude` once and log in).
#   - On GitHub: run `claude setup-token`, then add the token as the repository secret
#     CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN (see the README).
#
# Optional: phone alerts through the ntfy app (https://ntfy.sh). Copy this file to .env and set:
NTFY_TOPIC=
